{"t":"The Tainted Souls Quest","s":"the-tainted-souls-quest-883ea","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Star_Herb_baf66f.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">The Tainted Souls Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Adventurers%20Guild%20%28Quest%29\">Adventurers Guild (Quest)</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(30+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.80<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 21, 2015<br/>Summer Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>Release the Tainted Souls roaming the Green Claw Swamp from their plight.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Tainted%20Caves\">Tainted Caves</a> in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp\">Green Claw Swamp</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Tainted%20Soul\">Tainted Soul</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Toad\">Toad</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Witch\">Witch</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Gloom%20Wolf\">Gloom Wolf</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ekatrix\">Ekatrix</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>Chance to fight <a href=\"#/wiki/Ekatrix\">Ekatrix</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Requirements\">Requirements</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Antlers\">Antlers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Special%20Flask%20%28Holy%20Water%29\">Holy Water</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Star%20Herb\">Star Herb</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Obtaining_the_Items\">Obtaining the Items</span></h3>\n<p>First, you will need to obtain a <a href=\"#/wiki/Sacred%20Antler%20Talisman\">Sacred Antler Talisman</a>. To make one, you will need some <a href=\"#/wiki/Antlers\">Antlers</a>, looted from <a href=\"#/wiki/Deer\">Deer</a>; a <a href=\"#/wiki/Star%20Herb\">Star Herb</a>, looted from <a href=\"#/wiki/Witch\">Witches</a> or bought from <a href=\"#/wiki/Luna\">Luna</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>; and <a href=\"#/wiki/Special%20Flask%20%28Holy%20Water%29\">Holy Water</a>, able to be bought from <a href=\"#/wiki/Henricus\">Henricus</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> after reaching mission 4 of the <a href=\"#/quest/the-inquisition-quest\">The Inquisition Quest</a>.\n</p><p>When you have obtained all three of these items, use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Star%20Herb\">Star Herb</a> on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Antlers\">Antlers</a> to obtain <a href=\"#/wiki/Antler%20Talisman\">Antler Talisman</a>.<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Star%20Herb\"><img alt=\"Star Herb\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star_Herb_baf66f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> + <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Antlers\"><img alt=\"Antlers\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Antlers_6e8228.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> = <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Antler%20Talisman\"><img alt=\"Antler Talisman\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Antler_Talisman_375820.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> (<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You entwine the antler with fresh star herb.</span>)\n</p><p>Then use <a href=\"#/wiki/Special%20Flask%20%28Holy%20Water%29\">Holy Water</a> on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Antler%20Talisman\">Antler Talisman</a> to obtain <a href=\"#/wiki/Sacred%20Antler%20Talisman\">Sacred Antler Talisman</a>.<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Special%20Flask%20%28Holy%20Water%29\"><img alt=\"Special Flask (Holy Water)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Special_Flask_Holy_Water_691da3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> + <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Antler%20Talisman\"><img alt=\"Antler Talisman\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Antler_Talisman_375820.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> = <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sacred%20Antler%20Talisman\"><img alt=\"Sacred Antler Talisman\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sacred_Antler_Talisman_9bcfae.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> (<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You besprinkle the antler talisman with holy water. It glitters faintly.</span>)\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Freeing_the_Souls\">Freeing the Souls</span></h3>\n<p>With the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sacred%20Antler%20Talisman\">Sacred Antler Talisman</a>, head to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tainted%20Caves\">Tainted Caves</a> in the north of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp\">Green Claw Swamp</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32711,31939,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32711, 31939, 7)</a>. In this cave you will encounter <a href=\"#/wiki/Tainted%20Soul\">Tainted Souls</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Toad\">Toads</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Gloom%20Wolf\">Gloom Wolves</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Witch\">Witches</a>. The cave has 4 floors with the same monsters on each floor. Explore the caves and use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sacred%20Antler%20Talisman\">Sacred Antler Talisman</a> on all the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tainted%20Soul\">Tainted Souls</a> that you find. Do this until you have freed 100 souls. Note that you can free the summons as well. By luring two Tainted Souls on you and freeing their summons you can collect the required 100 in less than 10 minutes.\n</p><p>When freeing a soul, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Redeemed%20Soul\">Redeemed Soul</a> will spawn and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tainted%20Soul\">Tainted Soul</a> on which the talisman was used will despawn shortly afterwards. You don't have to kill the <a href=\"#/wiki/Redeemed%20Soul\">Redeemed Souls</a> since they will despawn 30 seconds after spawning. However, if you're interested on completing their <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclopedia\">Bestiary</a> entries, you will have those 30 seconds to kill each Redeemed Soul and a single turn to kill each Tainted Soul after successfully using the talisman it. Note that the <a href=\"#/wiki/Redeemed%20Soul\">Redeemed Soul</a> might not spawn if there isn't enough room around your character, but it still counts as a freed soul for the quest.\n</p><p><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sacred%20Antler%20Talisman\"><img alt=\"Sacred Antler Talisman\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sacred_Antler_Talisman_9bcfae.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> + <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tainted%20Soul\"><img alt=\"Tainted Soul\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tainted_Soul_68661f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> = <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Redeemed%20Soul\"><img alt=\"Redeemed Soul\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Redeemed_Soul_9ff070.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n</p><p>When you have freed 100 souls, go to the 4<sup>th</sup> floor and enter the <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mystic%20Flame\"><img alt=\"Mystic Flame\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mystic_Flame_94d45d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Mystic%20Flame\">Mystic Flame</a>. You will be teleported to a nearby room with <a href=\"#/wiki/Ekatrix\">Ekatrix</a>. Kill her. After entering the boss room, the quest will immediately restart and you can start freeing souls again. Ekatrix can only be killed once every 20 hours, however.\n</p>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Adventurers%20Guild%20%28Quest%29\">Adventurers Guild (Quest)</a></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["the-inquisition-quest"]}